{"t": 46.3, "command": "done", "args": ["Set the Battery element's Discharge cost to 0.01 $/kWh. HAEO turned that into a policy named 'Battery discharge cost' with source Battery and target Any, at 0.01 $/kWh, so every kWh discharged from the battery is charged that amount wherever it goes. I then tried to add a separate Battery->Any policy, but HAEO rejected it as a duplicate, so no extra rule was created and the wear cost is not counted twice. Verified in the policy edit dialog."], "error": null, "visible_errors": 0}
